riticizes policies on Iran, immigration and the Epstein files. Vance downplayed the remarks, defended deportation efforts and insisted the administration remains committed to its agenda amid tensions today.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/im-going-to-text-joe-jd-vance-fires-back-after-joe-rogan-slams-maga-supporters-as-unintelligent-and-dorks/articleshow/129886149.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/im-going-to-text-joe-jd-vance-fires-back-after-joe-rogan-slams-maga-supporters-as-unintelligent-and-dorks/articleshow/129886149.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-30T00:41:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129886660,imgsize-553177.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How ‘ghost taxi drivers’ in China tricked customers into paying without rides]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129884105.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In an odd twist in the realm of ride-hailing, a group of Chinese drivers resorted to chilling profile pictures to frighten passengers into canceling their rides, allowing them to pocket cancellation fees. Furthermore, some drivers would start rides only to leave without passengers or simply go AWOL, racking up additional penalties.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/how-ghost-taxi-drivers-in-china-tricked-customers-into-paying-without-rides/articleshow/129884105.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/etimes/trending/how-ghost-taxi-drivers-in-china-tricked-customers-into-paying-without-rides/articleshow/129884105.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-30T00:33:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Trending Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="im